    "description": "Our \"Bedtime Stories & Lullabies\" app for kids will quickly calm them for bedtime, lull them to sleep, and take them into the magical fairytale world of dreams. <b>Kind fairy tales, a soothing female voice, calming lullaby songs & music, white noise and beautiful illustrations</b> help babies, toddlers and kids up to 6 years old to fall asleep easily. <b>Handy player running offline and in the background, the option to read bedtime stories to kids yourself, and other useful features</b> will make it much easier for you to soothe babies and toddlers and to help them fall asleep.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude34 <b>All THE STORIES INVOLVE THE THEMES OF SLEEP AND DREAMING</b>\r\nWe have chosen calming moral fairy tales for kids with the kindest and most soothing plots. In each bedtime story the cute characters are certain to mention sleep, they learn about its usefulness or tell their friends how wonderful it is to dream interesting dreams. For example, the tale about a little tiger playing in Dreamland, or about a sleepy baby bear and baby fox, or on the contrary, about a stubborn little mouse who doesn't want to go to bed, but at the end of the story they all understand how important and useful it is to sleep soundly at night. The first 6 tales in the book are available for free and without any ads. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 <b>UNIQUE LULLABY SONG IN EACH AND EVERY BEDTIME STORY</b>\r\nFor each fairy tale, we have written a unique calm lullaby song that fits the plot. It is usually played at the end of the story to make it easier for babies, toddlers and kids to fall asleep. All these soothing lullabies can also be listened to separately as mixes of 2-3 songs. As a bonus, we have written a number of lullaby songs about seasons. The first lullaby song is available for free and without any ads.\r\n\r\n\u23f1 <b>SLEEP TIMER</b>\r\nThe app can play fairy tales and lullabies in the background with the screen switched off. And to make it easier for you to fall asleep, we've added the sleep timer that can be set for any time from 10 to 60 minutes. We've also added a mini player to the lock screen and notification panel.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfb <b>AUDIO TRACKS SELECTION</b>\r\nIn addition to the voiceover of the tale, you can also turn on a lullaby music or white noise: the sound of crickets or the sound of rain. Each audio track is separately adjustable in volume. The fairy tales are voiced in a gentle, soft female voice, but it may be useful to turn off voice over completely to soothe and lull your baby to sleep.\r\n\r\n\u23ef <b>HANDY PLAYER</b>\r\nBy default, \"Bedtime Stories & Lullabies\" app plays tales in a loop. But you can listen to them either in order or shuffled. If your toddler or kid only wants to listen to his or her most favorite fairy tales, just turn on the repeat function. In addition, all of the tales and lullabies in the audiobook can be listened to and read offline.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 <b>PARENT MODE</b>\r\nYou can read all the stories to your kid yourself by switching off the voice track and turning on the parent mode. At the same time, you can leave a calming lullaby music, white noise, or even turn off all the tracks. Also, the parent mode will help you quickly familiarize yourself with the plot of the story or lullaby before playing it to your baby.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>FAVORITE STORIES</b>\r\nThere are 15 calming fairy tales and 17 lullaby songs in our app. You can add any of them to the list of favorites. This way, your baby, toddler or kid can listen to only his or her favorite bedtime stories and lullabies.\r\n\r\n\u2728\ud83c\udf1d\ud83c\udf1f\r\nWe, the developers, also read these tales to our daughter before bedtime and hope that they will help your kid fall asleep as much as they help our own.\r\n\"Bedtime Stories & Lullabies\" app contains nothing but the kindest and calmest kids fairy tales and songs. They are about the importance of sleep and how everyone should go to bed on time to get a good night's rest and have magical dreams.",
